{"timestamp": "2026-02-04 19:24:19.718694", "event": "llm_start", "messages": "content='Based on the diagnosis report: ### Troubleshooting Diagnosis Report\\n\\n#### Network Health Assessment:\\nThe network is an SDN star topology with one central switch and multiple edge switches. Hosts are connected to edge switches, and all switches are managed by an SDN controller. The reachability test results indicate that there are anomalies in the network.\\n\\n#### Observed Anomalies:\\n1. **Host-to-Host Reachability Issues**:\\n   - **Host_2**:\\n     - Unable to reach **Host_1** (10.0.0.1). The status is marked as \"unknown,\" and no packets were transmitted or received.\\n     - Unable to reach **Host_8** (10.0.0.8). Similarly, the status is \"unknown,\" with no packet transmission or reception.\\n\\n2. **Other Hosts**:\\n   - All other hosts (Host_1, Host_3, Host_4, Host_5, Host_6, Host_7, Host_8) successfully communicated with each other. The packet loss is 0%, and the round-trip times (RTTs) are within acceptable ranges.\\n\\n#### Relevant Findings:\\n- **Host_2** appears to be isolated or experiencing connectivity issues. This could be due to:\\n  - A problem with the edge switch (Switch_2) connected to Host_2.\\n  - Misconfiguration or failure in the SDN controller affecting Host_2\\'s connectivity.\\n  - Network interface issues on Host_2 itself.\\n\\n- **Round-Trip Times (RTTs)**:\\n  - For hosts that successfully communicated, RTTs are consistent and within expected ranges, averaging around 44-47 ms. This indicates that the central switch and other edge switches are functioning correctly.\\n\\n#### Next Steps:\\nFurther investigation is required to localize the fault and identify the root cause of Host_2\\'s connectivity issues. This will involve examining the network configuration, switch status, and SDN controller logs related to Host_2 and Switch_2.\\n\\nThis concludes the initial diagnostic report., please provide the submission. Do not submit if no report available.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={} id='812f55f1-949f-4ba4-a516-5353c9872c7e'", "model": {"lc": 1, "type": "constructor", "id": ["langchain", "chat_models", "openai", "ChatOpenAI"], "kwargs": {"model_name": "kt-gpt-oss-rh014", "temperature": 0.0, "openai_api_key": {"lc": 1, "type": "secret", "id": ["OPENAI_API_KEY"]}, "openai_api_base": "https://dev.kora.kt.co.kr/v2", "request_timeout": 180.0, "max_retries": 2}, "name": "ChatOpenAI"}}
